7","id":3075369906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc63Tmuy","user":{"login":"richardscholtens","id":39763414,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzYzNDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39763414?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens","html_url":"https://github.com/richardscholtens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardscholtens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T20:09:44Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T20:17:43Z","body":"> > Sorry for the delay. I just tried the Viewset implementation, and it works as expected. I can successfully find the viewset tooling in ClaudeAI. Next step is to make Claude retrieve a JWT token for authentication before tries any tools. Thanks for this feature @Artui , really appreciated.\r\n> \r\n> Good news. I you are using claude chat interface you will probably need to setup oauth and dynamic client registration. You can find some elements here : [omarbenhamid/django-oauth-toolkit-dcr#2](https://github.com/omarbenhamid/django-oauth-toolkit-dcr/issues/2) You can also share your findings there.\r\n\r\nThanks! I will take a look. \r\n\r\nMy current setup involves an OIDC provider. I use the OIDCAuthentication from the [mozilla-django-oidc](https://github.com/mozilla/mozilla-django-oidc) package. It would be nice if I could get Claude on the same authentication protocol.\r\n\r\nSomething like this:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nDJANGO_MCP_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES = [\"mozilla_django_oidc.contrib.drf.OIDCAuthentication\", \"rest_framework_simplejwt.authentication.JWTAuthentication\"]\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/3075369906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/3102856104","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/27#issuecomment-3102856104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/27","id":3102856104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc648dOo","user":{"login":"gustahrodrigues","id":2227228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2227228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues","html_url":"https://github.com/gustahrodrigues","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustahrodrigues/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T13:56:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T13:56:34Z","body":"@Artui I apologize if I've misunderstoo